<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;color:#0D523F;">
  Your staff role was updated
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888B8B;">
  Permissions update
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Your staff role on Dukka has been updated for <strong>{{email}}</strong>. Your available actions in the portal may have changed based on this assignment.
</p>

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Staff email" value=email}}
  {{#if roleName}}
  {{> detail-row label="New role" value=roleName}}
  {{else}}
  {{> detail-row label="Role id" value=roleId}}
  {{/if}}
{{/details}}

{{#> tip title="What to do next"}}
  Sign in again if you are already in a session so your permissions refresh. If something you need is missing, ask an administrator to review your role.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  Stay productive — your updated role is ready whenever you are.
</p>
